sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as Backend API
    participant TL as Team Lead
    participant SA as Security Admin
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Audit as Audit Service

    Dev->>UI: Submit API Access Request
    UI->>API: POST /access-requests
    API->>DB: Store request (Pending)
    API->>Audit: Log request created
    API-->>TL: Notify pending approval

    TL->>API: Approve request
    API->>DB: Update status (Manager Approved)
    API->>Audit: Log manager approval

    SA->>API: Security approval
    API->>DB: Create User API Access
    API->>DB: Update request (Granted)
    API->>Audit: Log access granted
    API-->>Dev: Access Granted
